      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Taking into account the follow-up of coronary heart disease patients from the acute phase of illness up to the social reinsertion the author proposes an approach whose goal is to modify Pattern A Behavior. Various approaches as behaviorism, dynamic psychology and psychoanalysis are complementary and have each one its importance in order to treat these \"serious psychosomatic patients\" as are coronary heart disease patients."},
